New `/v1/score` route added:
Case 1 --> N cross-encoder pairs:
```
curl -X 'POST'  'http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/score' -H 'accept: application/json'  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
  "model": "BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3",
  "text_1": "What is the capital of France?",
  "text_2": [
    "The capital of Brazil is Brasilia.",
    "The capital of France is Paris."
  ]
}'
```
